\begin{CJK}{UTF8}{gbsn}
Q1. How satisfied are you with the service? (您对本次服务满意吗？)

Options: 1 = Very dissatisfied (非常不满意); 2 = Dissatisfied (不满意); 3 = Neutral (一般); 4 = Satisfied (满意); 5 = Very satisfied (非常满意).

Q2. Would you recommend the service? (您会推荐这项服务吗？)

Options: 1 = Definitely no (绝对不会); 2 = Probably no (可能不会); 3 = Unsure (不确定); 4 = Probably yes (可能会); 5 = Definitely yes (绝对会).
\end{CJK}
